    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\r\n\r\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\r\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\r\n\r\n### Module(s)\r\n\r\nmini.notify\r\n\r\n### Description\r\n\r\nHi, I would like a way of ignoring certain messages for specific LSP progress. \r\n\r\nFor example, `rust-analyzer` seems to be really loud about each event, and I would like to know only when it is ready:\r\n![2024-10-24-141757_hyprshot](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/614ba633-e955-4ce7-ba02-01ab091e6a81)\r\n\r\nIs there any way of doing this? Thanks!\r\n\r\n\r\n",
